=== <span class="anchor" id="Stepway"></span>Logan Stepway/Intens ===
Since the release of the facelift version, the Logan is also available with the [[Crossover (automobile)#Styled|crossover-styled]] Stepway trim, which feature raised ride height and adds exterior accessories such as black plastic [[Fender (vehicle)|wheel arch]] trims, body cladding, skid plates and roof rails. In February 2017, the Dacia Logan MCV Stepway in Europe.{{Clarify|reason=There is no verb in the sentence.|date=August 2022}}<ref>{{Cite web|title=Dacia Logan range to expand with new Stepway model|url=https://www.autotrader.co.uk/content/news/dacia-logan-range-to-expand-with-new-stepway-model|access-date=2021-02-21|website=Auto Trader UK}}</ref> Starting from 2018, the Stepway version also became available for the sedan version in Latin America,<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.elcarrocolombiano.com/autos-del-mundo/el-renault-logan-crossover-llego-a-ecuador-y-al-parecer-se-produce-en-colombia/|title=El Renault Logan Crossover llegó a Ecuador (y al parecer, se produce en Colombia)|first=Óscar Julián Restrepo|last=Mantilla|date=18 January 2019}}</ref> and from November 2019 in Europe.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.digi24.ro/stiri/economie/dacia-logan-stepway-a-fost-lansat-in-romania-foto-1216705|title=Dacia Logan Stepway a fost lansat în România - FOTO|website=www.digi24.ro|date=14 November 2019 }}</ref> The Renault Logan Stepway was launched in Russia in December 2018,<ref>{{Cite web|last=Gnaticov|first=Cristian|date=2018-08-19|title=Renault Logan Stepway Is A High-Riding Sedan For The Russian Market|url=https://www.carscoops.com/2018/08/renault-logan-stepway-high-riding-sedan-thats-natural-fit-russias-roads/|url-status=live|access-date=2021-02-21|website=Carscoops|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180823052052/https://www.carscoops.com/2018/08/renault-logan-stepway-high-riding-sedan-thats-natural-fit-russias-roads/ |archive-date=23 August 2018 }}</ref><ref>{{cite web|last1=Меньщиков|first1=Олег|title=Renault Logan и Sandero в версиях Stepway City: старт продаж|url=https://autoreview.ru/news/renault-logan-i-sandero-v-versiyah-stepway-city-start-prodazh|access-date=10 December 2018|website=autoreview.ru|date=10 December 2018}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|last1=Попов|first1=Леонид|title=Renault › Пара Renault Logan и Sandero Stepway City вышла дороже собратьев|url=https://www.drive.ru/news/renault/5c0e5ff2ec05c4a033000027.html|access-date=10 December 2018|website=www.drive.ru|date=10 December 2018 }}</ref> followed by Brazil in July 2019 along with the facelifted model without carrying the Stepway nameplate to avoid confusion with the Sandero-based Stepway.<ref>{{Cite web|last=Radu|first=Mihnea|date=2019-07-28|title=2020 Renault Sandero and Logan Get Facelift in Brazil, RS and Stepway Included|url=https://www.autoevolution.com/news/2020-renault-sandero-and-logan-get-facelift-in-brazil-rs-and-stepway-included-136335.html|access-date=2021-02-21|website=autoevolution|language=en}}</ref> In several South American markets including Colombia, the crossover version of the Renault Logan was available as the Intens top trim.<ref>{{Cite web|last=Ordóñez|first=Nicolás Ramírez|date=2020-11-19|title=Renault Logan Intens CVT, a prueba: Nueva faceta del sedán más popular (+VIDEO)|url=https://www.elcarrocolombiano.com/pruebas/renault-logan-intens-a-prueba-nueva-faceta-del-sedan-mas-popular-video/|access-date=2021-02-21|website=El Carro Colombiano|language=es-CO}}</ref>

For versions equipped with [[Continuously variable transmission|CVT]], the lifted version of the Logan is essentially a workaround to mitigate the fact that the CVT gearbox does not fit due to the tight space of the platform layout, which led to the vehicle being raised by fitting a reworked suspension. Without raising the ground clearance, the CVT unit would be too close to the ground and causes a risk of damage.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Renault Logan CVT Iconic 2020: Prós e Contras|trans-title=Renault Logan CVT Iconic 2020: Pros and Cons|url=https://motor1.uol.com.br/reviews/391059/renault-logan-cvt-iconic-2020-pros-e-contras/|url-status=live|access-date=2021-03-11|website=Motor1.com|language=pt|quote=A suspensão elevada e os apliques fazem parte do conjunto para a colocação do câmbio CVT na plataforma, que teve que ser elevada pelo formato e posição da caixa. Sem isso, ela ficaria próxima do solo e poderia ser danificada em alguma pancada.|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200612065342/https://motor1.uol.com.br/reviews/391059/renault-logan-cvt-iconic-2020-pros-e-contras/ |archive-date=12 June 2020 }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|date=2020-08-06|title=Review: Renault Logan CVT 2020|url=http://www.carsdrive.com.ar/pruebas/review-renault-logan-cvt-2020/|url-status=live|access-date=2021-03-11|website=CarsDrive Córdoba|language=es|quote=El tema es que, por cuestiones de disposición, la caja queda muy expuesta en la parte baja del auto, por lo que tuvieron que elevar el despeje del suelo en todos los automáticos, y eso terminó dando lugar a este Logan CVT y a una gama que la marca denomina Cross Light.|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210721231242/http://www.carsdrive.com.ar/pruebas/review-renault-logan-cvt-2020/ |archive-date=21 July 2021 }}</ref><gallery widths="200">
