=== 2025 refresh ===
On 6 October 2025, the Logan alongside the Sandero, Sandero Stepway and Jogger, received a heavy facelift featuring a redesigned front fascia, new headlights, new fog lights and new alloys, while the rear remains the same as the previous facelift.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Pappas |first=Thanos |title=Dacia’s Budget Stars Just Got A Serious Glow-Up |url=https://www.carscoops.com/2025/10/dacia-facelifted-europes-best-selling-car-and-its-siblings/ |access-date=2025-10-06 |website=Carscoops}}</ref>

===<span class="anchor" id="Taliant"></span><span class="anchor" id="Renault Taliant"></span><span class="anchor" id="LJF"></span> Renault Taliant (LJF)===
The Renault Taliant is a rebadged third-generation Logan. It was revealed in Turkey on 11 March 2021,<ref>{{Cite web|title=İşte karşınızda 2021 Renault Taliant! Symbol'ün yerine geçen Renault Taliant neler sunuyor?|trans-title=Here is the 2021 Renault Taliant! What does the Symbol replacement Renault Taliant offer?|url=https://www.sabah.com.tr/galeri/otomobil/iste-karsinizda-2021-renault-taliant-symbolun-yerine-gecen-renault-taliant-neler-sunuyor|url-status=live|access-date=2021-03-11|website=Sabah|language=tr|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210311134606/https://www.sabah.com.tr/galeri/otomobil/iste-karsinizda-2021-renault-taliant-symbolun-yerine-gecen-renault-taliant-neler-sunuyor |archive-date=11 March 2021 }}</ref> and went on sale on 24 May 2021.<ref>{{Cite web|date=2021-05-24|title=2021 Renault Taliant prices have been announced!|url=https://tr.motor1.com/news/509199/2021-renault-taliant-turkiye-fiyati/|url-status=live|access-date=2021-05-24|website=Motor1.com|language=tr|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210524140443/https://tr.motor1.com/news/509199/2021-renault-taliant-turkiye-fiyati/ |archive-date=24 May 2021 }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|date=2021-05-24|title=Renault Taliant to be launched in Turkey for the first time|url=https://www.aa.com.tr/tr/sirkethaberleri/otomotiv/renault-taliant-ilk-kez-turkiyede-satisa-sunulacak/665001|url-status=live|access-date=2021-05-24|website=www.aa.com.tr|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210524140441/https://www.aa.com.tr/tr/sirkethaberleri/otomotiv/renault-taliant-ilk-kez-turkiyede-satisa-sunulacak/665001 |archive-date=24 May 2021 }}</ref> Built in Morocco,<ref>{{Cite web |date=2025-10-23 |title=Usine de Casablanca (SOMACA) |url=https://www.renaultgroup.com/groupe/implantations/usine-casablanca-somaca/ |access-date=2025-12-29 |website=Renault Group |language=fr-FR}}</ref> the vehicle is overall largely similar on the Logan, sharing the same bodywork with changes on the front fascia, rear fascia, and side door shoulder lines. As with the Logan, the Taliant is based on the CMF-B LS platform.<ref>{{Cite web|last=terciar|date=2021-03-11|title=Renault Taliant: ¿se viene el reemplazo del Logan?|trans-title=Renault Taliant: Is The Logan Replacement Coming?|url=https://autotest.com.ar/noticias/renault-taliant-reemplazo-del-logan/|url-status=live|access-date=2021-03-11|website=Auto Test|language=es|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210311143130/https://autotest.com.ar/noticias/renault-taliant-reemplazo-del-logan/ |archive-date=11 March 2021 }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Renault превратила новый Logan в Taliant, чтобы заменить Symbol|trans-title=Renault turns new Logan into Taliant to replace Symbol|url=https://ru.motor1.com/news/493723/renault-taliant-turkey-pics/|url-status=live|access-date=2021-03-11|website=Motor1.com|language=ru|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210311150528/https://ru.motor1.com/news/493723/renault-taliant-turkey-pics/ |archive-date=11 March 2021 }}</ref> It is sold on various markets, such as Turkey, but also Ukraine, Georgia, Middle-East and in some African countries.<ref>{{cite web|access-date=2025-12-29 |language=uk-UA |title=Renault TALIANT |url=https://www.renault.ua/passenger/taliant.html |website=www.renault.ua}}<!-- auto-translated from French by Module:CS1 translator --></ref><ref>{{cite web|access-date=2025-12-29 |language=en |title=Renault Taliant |url=https://renault.com.eg/cars/taliant-ljf-ph1/overview.html |website=renault.com.eg}}<!-- auto-translated from French by Module:CS1 translator --></ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Renault Taliant |url=https://renault.ge/cars/taliant-ljf-ph1/overview.html |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251202171540/https://renault.ge/cars/taliant-ljf-ph1/overview.html |archive-date=2025-12-02 |access-date=2025-12-29 |website=renault.ge}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|access-date=2025-12-29 |language=fr |title=Renault Taliant |url=https://www.renault.ga/cars/taliant-ljf-ph1/overview.html |website=www.renault.ga}}<!-- auto-translated from French by Module:CS1 translator --></ref>

The name "Taliant" is derived from the word "talent".<ref>{{Cite web|date=2021-03-11|title=Седан Renault Taliant: новый Logan в другом костюме|trans-title=Renault Taliant sedan: new Logan in a different suit|url=https://autoreview.ru/news/sedan-renault-taliant-novyy-logan-v-drugom-kostyume|url-status=live|access-date=2021-03-12|website=autoreview.ru|language=ru|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210311201048/https://autoreview.ru/news/sedan-renault-taliant-novyy-logan-v-drugom-kostyume |archive-date=11 March 2021 }}</ref>

In 2025, the Taliant was removed from Renault's Turkish website. After 2025 refresh for model year 2026 Renault Taliant rebadged to Dacia Logan in Turkey.<ref>{{Cite web |date=2026-02-18 |title=Dacia Logan, 2026'da Türkiye'ye geri dönüyor |url=https://www.donanimhaber.com/dacia-logan-2026-da-turkiye-ye-geri-donuyor--202277 |access-date=2026-02-19 |website=DonanımHaber |language=tr}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Dacia Started the Year 2026 Ambitiously: The Renewed Model Family Hits the Road |url=http://www.oyak.com.tr/en/oyak-companies/company-news/dacia-started-the-year-2026-ambitiously-the-renewed-model-family-hits-the-road |access-date=2026-02-19 |website=OYAK |language=en}}</ref>

